{"text": "BRIC GARCETT\nMAYOR\n\nFebruary 24, 2020\nVIA E-MAIL: (88128-27199001@requests.muckrock.com)\nDavid Bixenspan\nRe: California Public Records Act Request\nDear Mr. Bixenspan,\n\n\u2018This letter responds to your February 13, 2020 California Public Records Act (\u201cCPRA\u201d) request to\nthe Office of the Mayor of Los Angeles (\u201cOffice\u201d) secking the following:\n\n+ \u201cAll documents related to the 2021 WrestleMania event, including but not limited to\ndocuments from the bidding process and World Wrestling Entertainment guidance for the\npress conference announcing the event\u201d (\u201cRequest\u201d).\n\n\u2018After a diligent search, we have determined that the Office does not have possession, custody, or\ncontrol of any records that are responsive to your Request.\n\nSincerely,\n\nAY Fhe\n\nSKYLER GRAY\nDeputy Legal Counsel\nMayor Eric Garcetti",
